 =?UTF-8?q?and=20centred=20=E2=80=94=20the=20shell=20measures=20each=20ico?=
 =?UTF-8?q?n's=20drawn=20part=20(apps'=20pixmaps=20fill=20their=20canvas,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Papirus=20panel=20icons=20like=20Spotify's=20are=2016=20in?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=2022)=20and=20scales=20it=20to=20fit?=
